+# Korean interface (ko)
+
+> **Last updated:** 2026-10-13 · **Change:** major (Korean interface added on 0.7.1)
+
+Edit › Interface Language › 한국어 (`app.language {"lang": "ko"}`). A first launch (no saved
+`ui.json`) on a Korean system starts in Korean (see [System locale](#system-locale)). Related:
+[localization-parity.md](localization-parity.md), [cjk.md](cjk.md) (Korean typesetting).
+
+## Provenance
+
+The catalog is `crates/ui-egui/src/i18n/ko.rs` (English → Korean, one row per string).
+
+| Rows | Source |
+|---|---|
